# Nothing is required. The desk runs fully scripted with zero secrets, locally and on Vercel.
# The optional LIVE QUAKES overlay reads the public USGS earthquake feed through /api/events
# (no key, 4 s timeout, 5 min cache, scripted fallback on any error).
#
# This app reads no env vars today. If a Claude powered live mode is added later it must reuse
# the sibling names from apps/claude-agent-loops, server side only, and add no new secret names:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_WORKSPACE_ID=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=
# ANTHROPIC_EFFORT=
